<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="tracera-diagram-gen" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="27-pull-request-opening" name="Opening a pull request"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="frame" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1600" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="titlebar" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FF6B35;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="26" width="56" height="5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Opening a pull request&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=26;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="36" width="1520" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="The fourth authorized action: after a successful push, an owner session can open a pull request whose text is built from stored facts." style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="74" width="1520" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a0" value="&lt;b&gt;1  Request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;POST /api/v1/patches/:id/actions with kind pull_request, the same route as apply, commit and push. Owner session only: tokens and MCP get session_required. A hosted server refuses before anything is recorded." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="125" width="360" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="&lt;b&gt;2  Checks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The patch is approved. acknowledged_outcome equals the recorded verification outcome and acknowledged_risks is true unless it is verified. One action runs per repository at a time; Idempotency-Key replays are supported." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="125" width="360" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b&gt;3  Needs a push&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A successful push for this patch must exist (push_required otherwise) and TRACERA_GITHUB_TOKEN must be set (github_token_missing names the variable)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="812" y="125" width="360" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b&gt;4  Find the target&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The head is the branch of the latest push. The repository comes from that remote URL: only https://github.com/OWNER/REPO or git@github.com:OWNER/REPO. Anything else is remote_not_github and is never echoed." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1198" y="125" width="360" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b0" value="&lt;b&gt;5  Build the text&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The base is the request's base or the repository default. The title is the request's or the patch summary ([mock] first for a mock patch). The description comes from stored rows, never from a model." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="375" width="360" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b1" value="&lt;b&gt;6  What it says&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Summary, diagnosis with its stored status, files changed, and the stored outcome with the checks that ran and did not. Anything but verified reads Not verified. Model and repository text is quoted as inert lines, secrets redacted." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="375" width="360" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b2" value="&lt;b&gt;7  Call GitHub&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One call with the token; redirects are never followed. The token stays in the process environment, never in a URL, a log or a file." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A89888;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="812" y="375" width="360" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3" value="&lt;b&gt;8  Record the result&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only what GitHub answered: URL, number, source github or stand_in. A timeout or 5xx is github_unreachable (the pull request may or may not exist). Tracera never merges or edits it afterwards." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1198" y="375" width="360" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c0" value="&lt;b&gt;In the web app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;After a successful push the patch review panel offers Open pull request: a title field prefilled from the patch summary, an Open as a draft checkbox and Confirm pull request. A real result reads [live] Opened pull request #N on GitHub with a link; a stand-in reads [mock] and has no link." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="615" width="490" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="&lt;b&gt;Push authentication&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;When TRACERA_GITHUB_TOKEN is set and the push address is a github.com https URL, the push authenticates with the token alone, handed to git through the process environment only. Any other address, or no token, keeps the machine's git credentials." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="555" y="615" width="490" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Configuration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TRACERA_GITHUB_TOKEN (secret): one fine-grained personal access token limited to the target repository, with Contents: Read and write and Pull requests: Read and write. Metadata: Read is added by GitHub." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="615" width="490" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s0" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t0" value="Request, check or build step" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="860" width="212" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A89888;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="316" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t1" value="GitHub" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="358" y="860" width="54" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="434" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t2" value="Key decision" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="476" y="860" width="97" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="595" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t3" value="Notes" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="637" y="860" width="46" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t4" value="Next" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="751" y="860" width="39" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a0" target="a1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a1" target="a2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a2" target="a3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a3" target="b0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1360" y="345"/><mxPoint x="220" y="345"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b0" target="b1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b1" target="b2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b2" target="b3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="705" y="871" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="743" y="871" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
